XCOMM Imakefile for 2089's X frontends: x2089 (Xlib only) in xlib/ and
XCOMM xm2089 (Motif) in motif/.  The X way to build them:
XCOMM
XCOMM     xmkmf -a
XCOMM     make
XCOMM
XCOMM (On AIX, imake's rules call the compiler cc_r: have /usr/vac/bin on
XCOMM PATH.)  Without Motif, build xlib/ on its own: xmkmf and make there.
XCOMM
XCOMM Author: Claude Opus 5.5 (claude-opus-5-5), October 2026.
XCOMM MIT License; see LICENSE.

#define IHaveSubdirs
#define PassCDebugFlags

        SUBDIRS = xlib motif

MakeSubdirs($(SUBDIRS))
DependSubdirs($(SUBDIRS))
